// Copy to Local.xcconfig and fill in your own team id, then run `xcodegen generate`.
//
// Find it in Xcode → Settings → Accounts → your Apple ID → Manage Certificates,
// or leave it blank and set the Team in the target's Signing & Capabilities tab.
// A free Apple ID works for running on your own device; certificates last 7 days.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
